{
  "$comment": "Every pairing the rules allow (docs/design-system.md), checked in both looks and both themes by scripts/check-contrast.mjs. fg is drawn on each token in on. kind sets the floor. A token in on that is transparent is measured on each of transparentOn instead (a transparent row is drawn on the page or on a card). when: the pair counts only if that token is not the value given. skipIfTransparent: the pair counts only if fg is not transparent in that look.",
  "floors": {
    "text": 4.5,
    "edge": 3,
    "notice": 4.5
  },
  "transparentOn": ["bg", "surface"],
